<title>RUSSIA: Russia Oct money supply rises to 278.8 trln rbls.</title>
<headline>Russia Oct money supply rises to 278.8 trln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian M2 money supply rose to 278.8 trillion roubles in October from a downwards revised 276.0 trillion in November, the central bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN MONEY SUPPLY	   Nov 1     Oct 1     Jan 1</p>
<p>    M2 volume			  278.8     276.0R     220.8</p>
<p>    cash in circulation (MO)	94.4	96.2R	80.8</p>
<p>NOTES - Volumes in trillion roubles. Monthly figures expressed as totals on first day of following month. Figures for 1995 not available.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
